{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_reliable_delivery", "label": "Reliable delivery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds sequence numbers and ACKs to the plain tell contract for workloads where loss is unacceptable \u2014 payment instructions, audit records, billing events. For telemetry and metrics plain tell is right; the controllers cost ~50 microseconds per message plus bookkeeping."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_sequence_numbers", "label": "Sequence numbers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strictly increasing from 1, per producer, so multiple producers have independent seq spaces; retransmits reuse the same seq, which is what makes dedup possible and preserves in-stream order."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_effectively_once", "label": "effectively-once", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The controller's in-memory dedup catches the common retransmit-before-ACK case; a handler-side persisted processed seq catches consumer crashes mid-processing. Together, and with a persisted producer in-flight buffer, they give end-to-end effectively-once; without persistence recovery on both sides resets to zero."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_broker_comparison", "label": "Controllers vs. broker-mediated delivery", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both reach at-least-once with seq-based dedup. The controllers are low operational complexity and sub-millisecond but cluster-internal and throughput-bound by single-actor processing; a broker adds an operational component and latency but serves external consumers and scales independently."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_reliable_delivery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_sequence_numbers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_reliable_delivery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_reliable_delivery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_consumer_controller_consumercontroller", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_effectively_once", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_sequence_numbers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_effectively_once", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_ack_semantics_persist_before_resolve", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_broker_comparison", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_reliable_delivery", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "at_least_once_delivery_flow", "label": "The at-least-once delivery flow", "nodes": ["docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_consumer_controller_consumercontroller", "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_ack_semantics_ack", "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_overview_sequence_numbers", "docs_src_content_docs_de_delivery_ack_semantics_confirmation_callback"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/delivery/overview.mdx"}]}